Package: litterbox-server
Version: 0.1-9
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Litterbox <litterbox@example.com>
Depends: systemd, libc6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Litterbox home application server
 Self-hosted API server for the Litterbox personal task inbox
 (cards, ingest, Gmail sync, reminders, journal).
 .
 Installs the release-built binary at
 /opt/litterbox/server/litterbox and the systemd unit
 litterbox-server.service. Configuration in /etc/litterbox
 (database credentials, environment) is never bundled.
 Operator SQL migrations ship under
 /usr/share/litterbox-server/db for reference.
